@startuml
title RNF1 — Transações ACID em dados de usuários, carreiras e database do jogo · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "MatchSimulator" as MatchSimulator
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
database "Cassandra 4.1" as Cassandra
database "OpenSearch 2" as OpenSearch
Manager -> Frontend: criar carreira (liga, franquia, database do jogo)
Frontend -> API: POST /careers
API -> UseCase: CreateCareerUseCase.execute (Transactional)
UseCase -> MySQL: BEGIN · SELECT world TEMPLATE
UseCase -> MySQL: INSERT world SAVE + ligas, franquias, jogadores, depth charts, playbooks, LeagueRules (clone)
alt franquia fora da liga / slot ocupado / elenco inconsistente
  UseCase -> MySQL: ROLLBACK
  API --> Frontend: 422 RFC 7807 {type, title, status, code, message, details, correlationId, locale} (nada gravado)
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: INSERT career_save, contrato, moral, game_plan, temporada
  UseCase -> MySQL: COMMIT
  UseCase -> OpenSearch: afterCommit: indexa jogadores do mundo SAVE
  API --> Frontend: 201 carreira
end
Manager -> Frontend: reordena o depth chart
Frontend -> API: PUT /careers/{id}/depth-chart (version)
API -> UseCase: UpdateDepthChartUseCase.execute
UseCase -> MySQL: UPDATE depth_chart WHERE version = ?
alt versão divergente
  MySQL --> UseCase: OptimisticLock
  API --> Frontend: 409 CONCURRENT_UPDATE
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: COMMIT
  API --> Frontend: 200
end
Manager -> Frontend: avançar a partida
Frontend -> API: POST /matches/{mid}/advance
API -> UseCase: AdvanceMatchUseCase.execute (Transactional)
UseCase -> MatchSimulator: advance(snapshot)
MatchSimulator --> UseCase: snapshot + jogadas
UseCase -> MySQL: UPDATE match_session WHERE version = ? · COMMIT
UseCase -> Cassandra: afterCommit: PlayEvent (idempotente por fixtureId + seq)
UseCase -> Redis: afterCommit: novo estado vivo
API --> Frontend: 200
@enduml
